This directory contains Alembic database migration scripts.

To create a new migration:
  alembic revision -m "description"

To apply migrations:
  alembic upgrade head

To generate a migration from model changes (requires SQLAlchemy models):
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Note: This project uses raw psycopg2, not SQLAlchemy models, so autogenerate
is not available. Migrations must be written manually.